        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Carrie Coon, Ben Affleck, Rosamund Pike, Lee Pace\n- Films: Gone Girl, The Keeping Hours\n- Places: Missouri\n- Roles: Margo Dunne, Nick Dunne, Amy\n\nFacts:\n- In 2014, Carrie Coon starred as Margo Dunne in the thriller film \"Gone Girl.\"\n- \"Gone Girl\" is set in Missouri and begins as a mystery about the events surrounding Nick Dunne, played by Ben Affleck, becoming the primary suspect in the sudden disappearance of his wife Amy, played by Rosamund Pike.\n- \"The Keeping Hours\" stars Lee Pace and Carrie Coon.",
